        "summary": "Linear Dy3 cluster with intramolecular ferromagnetic Dy···Dy coupling and SMM slow relaxation under zero dc field. χMT is nearly temperature-independent down to ~26 K then rises sharply at low T. Magnetization at 7 T does not saturate. Arrhenius analysis of ac data gives Ueff/kB = 37.83 K and τ0 = 5.04×10−7 s. Cole–Cole fits indicate multiple relaxation processes. Ab initio/POLY_ANISO simulation used J = 7.5 cm−1.",
